+# Production Enablement Checklist (detailed)
+
+Before enabling automated promotions or broad RL automation:
+
+Security & Supply Chain:
+- [ ] KMS key provisioned and cosign-kms secret created in k8s (namespace: security)
+- [ ] CI secret COSIGN_AWS_KMS_KEY_ARN set in GitHub Actions
+- [ ] cert-manager installed and cosign admission TLS cert issued & CA bundle populated
