+
+Verifier & Safety:
+- [ ] SME datasets registered & state=approved in SME Dataset Registry
+- [ ] Verifier finetune + calibration run successfully with thresholds published to ConfigMap
+- [ ] Adversarial & fairness suites pass; artefacts archived
+- [ ] SME signoffs captured and archived in evidence bucket
+
+Operational Validation:
+- [ ] Long shadow cronworkflow running and evidence uploading
+- [ ] Extended canary windows (24-72h) executed for sample artifacts
+- [ ] Chaos tests performed and rollback behavior validated
+- [ ] Promotion controller idempotency tested (apply CR twice) and logs archived
+
+Observability & Sustainability:
+- [ ] Wattmeter calibration job executed on representative hosts and validation MAE within threshold
+- [ ] Carbon intensity integration validated (carbon_validate.py) and used by scheduler
+- [ ] Kernel autotuner executed on representative GPU nodes and best config applied to Triton
+
+Org & Compliance:
+- [ ] SRE on-call roster published and trained on runbooks
+- [ ] Legal signoff on S3 Object Lock retention period (archive evidence)
+- [ ] Billing integration tested (tenant budgets & throttle)
+- [ ] Rater capacity & SLA defined and resourced
+
+Go / No-go:
+- [ ] All items above completed and evidence archived -> enable limited auto-promotion for low-risk flows
